        },
        {
          "text": "Kuti umwi muntu wabaabo batali bazumini amutamba kukulya awe, nkabela mwayanda kuya, kamulya zyoonse zili buti nzimweengezezegwa, mutadooneki nkaambo kamanjezeezya aanu pe. ",
